# RESQ-AI — Environment Variables Template
# ------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values ONLY if you extend the
# project to need them. Never commit the real .env file.
#
# IMPORTANT: As shipped, RESQ-AI needs ZERO API keys. Every external
# service used (Esri World Imagery, Open-Meteo, OpenStreetMap Overpass,
# OpenStreetMap Nominatim, OSRM, RainViewer) is free and public with no
# authentication required. This file exists for the optional FastAPI
# backend below, and as a placeholder if you add a paid/authenticated
# data source later (e.g. a licensed satellite imagery provider).

# --- Optional: FastAPI backend config (api/main.py) ---
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8000

# --- Optional: only needed if you upgrade to a paid imagery provider ---
# SENTINEL_HUB_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# SENTINEL_HUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here

# --- Optional: only needed if you upgrade rainfall to a licensed source ---
# WEATHER_API_KEY=your_key_here
